interpolation from the pre-computed \code{dlnm::crosspred} grid stored in
each \code{climasus_dlnm} object — no re-fitting or additional \code{dlnm} calls
are needed.

The \strong{sensitivity index} for stratum \eqn{s} is defined as:

\deqn{SI_s = \log RR_s(\texttt{hot\_percentile}) + \log RR_s(\texttt{cold\_percentile})}

a combined measure of total climate-attributable vulnerability (heat + cold).
